# MASTER PROMPT: SHANGRILLA RESTAURANT & DHABA MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as an expert full-stack developer, software architect, UI/UX designer, database engineer, restaurant POS specialist, inventory management specialist, and cybersecurity engineer.

Build a complete, functional, professional restaurant ordering and management platform named **SHANGRILLA** for one restaurant and one dhaba in Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh, India.

This must be a real, connected web application, not merely a static website or a visual prototype. All major buttons, forms, dashboards, orders, stock operations, and administrative controls must work and persist data.

If external services or credentials are required, implement the integration structure and explain how to configure them. Never pretend an unconfigured feature is operational.

